# Allow-list gitignore: "*" blocks everything; "!" re-allows one path with a reason.

*

!/.gitignore
# Why: the allow-list itself must be versioned so every clone agrees on what is source.

!/project.yml
# Why: XcodeGen source of truth; pikicam.xcodeproj is generated from it.

!/pikicam.xcodeproj/
!/pikicam.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/
!/pikicam.xcodeproj/xcshareddata/
# Why: the generated project, workspace and SHARED schemes are committed so a
# clean clone passes `git diff --exit-code` determinism and CI can build
# without xcodegen; xcuserdata stays blocked by "*".

!/.swiftlint.yml
# Why: strict lint is a gate; the config must not drift per machine.
!/.swift-format
# Why: same for formatting.
!/.periphery.yml
# Why: dead-code scope is a reviewed decision (D8), not local taste.

!/fixtures/
!/fixtures/device/SHA256SUMS.txt
!/fixtures/device/probe-results.json
# Why: fixture payloads are device-specific multi-MB DNGs (blocked), but their
# SHA256 register and the probe JSON are the reproducibility evidence.

!/scripts/
!/scripts/verify.sh
# Why: the local verification entry point (device suite + lint + oracles).
!/scripts/make-synthetic-bayer.py
# Why: regenerates the dng_validate-clean parser fixture deterministically.
!/scripts/calibrate.py
# Why: Phase A analysis over the captured flat series.
!/scripts/reference-diff.py
# Why: LibRaw bracket oracle for the develop pipeline.
!/scripts/host-render.swift
# Why: the our-side neutral render feeding the bracket (same CIRAWFilter
# front end as the app, on the macOS host).
!/scripts/colorcheck.py
# Why: deltaE2000 per ColorChecker patch (Tier 1 calibration).
!/scripts/p3-luminance.py
# Why: derives the mono kernel luminance constants from the P3 primaries.
!/scripts/fuzz-corpus.py
# Why: deterministic parser fuzz (50-variant smoke per run, full in CI).

!/pikicam/
# Why: the app is the product; all sources, assets, fonts, haptics.

!/pikicamTests/
# Why: unit + develop tests mirror the app tree.
pikicamTests/Fixtures/*.DNG
# Why not: multi-MB device captures; SHA-registered outside git.

!/pikicamUITests/
# Why: XCUITest suite (fake-mode journeys on device).

!/pikicamDeviceTests/
# Why: probe assertions that need real hardware.

!/Probes/
# Why: the claims ledger is re-provable only if the probe app ships.

!/README.md
# Why: inversion documentation (intent/decisions/constraints/gotchas).
!/AGENTS.md
# Why: operating contract for coding agents (<= 80 lines).
!/docs/
!/docs/DECISIONS.md
# Why: claims ledger + deviations with reversal conditions.
!/docs/DIAGNOSIS.md
# Why: the recorded failures the rebuild fixes; evidence for every cut.
!/docs/WALK.md
# Why: the acceptance walk definition and the measured budget numbers.

.DS_Store
build/
.build/
DerivedData/
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
